{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birb Game</strong> takes the raw joy of flight and turns it into a competitive race for dominance. Whether you are navigating the tight corridors of a rusted factory or catching drafts between the skyscrapers of a sprawling metropolis, every flap counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget complex flight sims\u2014this is about momentum, line optimization, and looking better than your rivals. With a streamlined 3-button control scheme, the barrier to entry is low, but the path to the top of the leaderboards is paved with practice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Across the World (and beyond):</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The High-Rise City</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/extras/ad8b53403906fc33cd1c6d7742114d9d.avif?t=1769003556\" width=1560 height=758 /></span><strong></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Industrial Factory</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/extras/ed83fe8c7389015ea81272eaca7e1a0e.avif?t=1769003556\" width=1560 height=758 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Floating Island Town</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/extras/1dc732a68a8a5d2451ea867040297f0a.avif?t=1769003556\" width=1560 height=758 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Race against friends (or enemies) via Online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards:</strong> Compare your best times against the world\u2019s most elite birbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Birb Customization:</strong> A bird is only as good as its accessories. Choose from a variety of hats to define your look on the podium.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/extras/94ab9152d1122486f0cc0e3e87cf6ca0.avif?t=1769003556\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/extras_big/94ab9152d1122486f0cc0e3e87cf6ca0.avif?t=1769003556 width=800 height=152 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper-Focused Gameplay:</strong> No fluff. Just pure, 3-button aerial racing designed for competitive play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What a diva","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3682550/d2254b89a4a7af9a3e44192de513505e711872a7.jpg"},{"name":"Way down we go!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3682550/518eed7c334722e82c7647466c11683803d6fbbd.jpg"},{"name":"Best birb far and wide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3682550/2d230a6002a704df6a3fb58c5e191f44d8111e68.jpg"},{"name":"Be the best birb self","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3682550/891414da5b27af8dd68a83ad543f54a9dfd42db9.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682550?t=1769003556","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/a6828f89685d18b92651840c270e645f41223502/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769003556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/650fc091f23a812bc75e256b6f1f648d07d76805/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769003556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/650fc091f23a812bc75e256b6f1f648d07d76805/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769003556","categories":